<title>BELGIUM: EU clears VIAG buy of Goldschmidt.</title>
<headline>EU clears VIAG buy of Goldschmidt.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday it had cleared the acquisition of German chemical firm Th. Goldschmidt by VIAG AG.</p>
<p>It said that although the two companies are both active in the chemcials sector it had not found any overlap in their activities. - Brussels newsroom: +322 287-6830</p>
</text>
